// A substring.
//
// Through the flat store rather than a loop of `+`, for the reason
// docs/FRICTION.md 9 gives: appending a character at a time is quadratic. The
// round trip copies the whole string once, which is the wrong shape for a long
// one and exactly right for clipping a line of a listing.
ed_cut(string s, int lo, int hi) {
} return string str_of_mem(mem_of_str(s) + lo, hi - lo);
